English terms (the Simplified Chinese terms prevail in case of ambiguity)

1. Purpose
An individual may use, copy, and modify this Skill and its accompanying prompt
rules, LOOK text, documentation, and scripts (the Materials) solely for personal,
non-commercial learning, research, and experimentation.

2. Non-commercial sharing
Free redistribution of original or modified Materials is permitted only with this
complete license, copyright notice, and personal-study/non-commercial restrictions
retained. Mark modifications clearly and do not imply endorsement by the original
author. Do not charge for the Materials or access to them, or include them in paid
bundles, courses, or services.

3. No commercial use
Without separate written permission from the relevant rights holders, commercial
use, direct or indirect, is prohibited. Examples include sales, paid licensing,
client work, commissioned images, advertising, product promotion, commercial
content production, paid APIs/SaaS, paid courses, and commercial model or dataset
development. Business, production, or internal operational use by companies or
institutions is not granted. Content generated or assisted by the Materials must
not be used for these commercial purposes.

4. Rights boundary
This license grants only rights in the Materials that the relevant rights holders
can grant. It grants no rights to third-party trademarks, likenesses, reference
assets, models, or platforms. Their applicable terms still apply. It does not
claim copyright over all generated results or replace third-party permission.

5. No warranty
The Materials are provided as is, without guarantees of accuracy, fitness,
availability, or output quality. To the extent permitted by applicable law, the
relevant rights holders are not liable for losses arising from their use.

6. Termination
Permission terminates upon breach. Stop using and further distributing the
Materials. This license does not alter terms applicable to copies previously
obtained under another license.

